    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avi Games presents the newest game in the Big Adventure series with Big Adventure: Trip to Europe 4!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with challenging hidden-object scenes and clever mini-games, this European holiday offers a vacation experience like no other! You'll visit 30 incredible locations across 15 different countries, take in the beauty of national parks, have a look around inspiring museums, trek through ancient castles, and so much more! Pack your bags and ready your skills for adventure in this all-new hidden-object experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collector\u2019s Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight additional locations to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the beautiful soundtrack at your side with the handy music player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills with 12 bonus mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive wallpapers to download and enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and display souvenirs to remember your trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
